{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a brutal medieval battleground where survival is the only option! In this action-packed wave survival game, you'll fight against relentless waves of enemies, each more powerful than the last. But you're not alone\u2014harness unique superpowers to devastate your foes and breed pigs with special abilities to aid you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Wave-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle endless waves of medieval warriors, each with unique strengths and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Superpowered Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating powers to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d9354a49a512281ffaa820b9141fe519.poster.avif?t=1757655820\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d9354a49a512281ffaa820b9141fe519.webm?t=1757655820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/d9354a49a512281ffaa820b9141fe519.mp4?t=1757655820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Pig Breeding System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise and enhance pigs with special powers to fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/324ab633324da38983b48e55ec5abe25.poster.avif?t=1757655820\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/324ab633324da38983b48e55ec5abe25.webm?t=1757655820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/324ab633324da38983b48e55ec5abe25.mp4?t=1757655820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities, improve your stats, and customize your combat strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/2ba6d5531baa526d12dae068fa2e5cec.poster.avif?t=1757655820\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/2ba6d5531baa526d12dae068fa2e5cec.webm?t=1757655820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/extras/2ba6d5531baa526d12dae068fa2e5cec.mp4?t=1757655820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly difficult foes that test your skills and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Can you survive the onslaught and become the ultimate medieval warrior? Fight, adapt, and conquer!</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313330?t=1757655820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313330?t=1757655820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/ebaace4e7b7cb1ace00d41ba82334e86fa7f77f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757655820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313330/ebaace4e7b7cb1ace00d41ba82334e86